  "2026-10-03T16:32:57.903Z","harness:codex","Early executable boundaries must reuse the shared SDK bootstrap resolver instead of maintaining separate flag heuristics. Verify output precedence across stale read warnings, blocked mutations, ordinary parser/validation failures, repeated attached/separate formats and the terminator. Add subprocess acceptance because in-process command runners bypass the executable compatibility boundary. Persist linked suites without overlapping commands; changing list timestamps are presentation metadata, so mutation preservation assertions compare persisted items/count."
